 18:15 \u2013 Council 5\u2011minute review and confirmation.\n- 18:20 \u2013 Pot redistribution if any villager below 1.00 unit.\n\n**Article VI: Ancillary Provisions**\n- The log\u2011keeper\u2019s duty takes <1\u202fmin; council members devote 5\u202fmin to review; pot redistribution takes <5\u202fmin.\n- No fishing time is sacrificed beyond routine activities.\n\n**Article VII: Adoption**\n- This policy is submitted for council voting. Upon approval it becomes binding for all villagers moving forward."}
