| Issue | Current wording | Suggested concrete change |
|-------|-----------------|---------------------------|
| **Consecutive‑shortfall rule** | “record the shortfall but do not move the pot that day…once a consecutive shortfall of at least 2 days” | Specify *exactly* which two days count: “the current day and the following day” (or the previous two days) and give a clear deadline: “the pot must be opened no later than the *second* consecutive shortfall day.” |
| **Pot‑keeper hand‑off** | “receipt of the current pot quantity” | Define the **unit measure** on the receipt (“number of unit‑packs” or “decimal‑units”) and require the same receipt to be posted in the hall for 24 hrs before the next keeper takes over – so everyone can see the exact count. |
