- Three consecutive days where the RCO fails to compile or sign the ledger by 7:15 pm triggers a one‑week fishing break (Monday to Sunday). A council vote on the following Friday afternoon decides if the RCO can resume duties. They must demonstrate all ledgers for the week before returning.

